{"code":20000,"message":"OK","data":{"items":[{"article":null,"author":{"avatar":"https://wpimg-wscn.awtmt.com/571933c7-b3e8-4877-8b6b-ed1b1765b4fa","display_name":"石惠","id":6029,"is_followed":false,"uri":"https://wallstreetcn.com/authors/6029"},"ban_comment":false,"channels":["global-channel","us-stock-channel"],"comment_count":0,"content":"\u003cp\u003e礼来：SOFE-M联合贝伐珠单抗治疗卵巢癌的确认客观缓解率为79%。\u003c/p\u003e\n","content_more":"","content_text":"礼来：SOFE-M联合贝伐珠单抗治疗卵巢癌的确认客观缓解率为79%。","cover_images":[],"display_time":1792823857,"fund_codes":[],"global_channel_name":"7x24快讯","global_more_uri":"wscn://wallstreetcn.com/live","has_live_reading":false,"highlight_title":"","id":3185110,"images":[],"is_calendar":false,"is_favourite":false,"is_priced":false,"is_scaling":false,"reference":"","related_themes":[],"score":1,"symbols":[],"tags":[],"title":"","type":"live","uri":"https://wallstreetcn.com/livenews/3185110"},{"article":null,"author":{"avatar":"https://wpimg-wscn.awtmt.com/571933c7-b3e8-4877-8b6b-ed1b1765b4fa","display_name":"石惠","id":6029,"is_followed":false,"uri":"https://wallstreetcn.com/authors/6029"},"ban_comment":false,"channels":["global-channel","a-stock-channel","xgb-channel"],"comment_count":0,"content":"\u003cp\u003e10月24日，智元在山东济南组织110台远征A3全尺寸人形机器人同时跳舞，创下“最多人形机器人同时跳舞”吉尼斯世界纪录。此次挑战采用智元灵动LinkBots集群调控平台及UWB厘米级定位技术，实现多机同步动作与编队切换。据悉，这批机器人后续将陆续投入文旅演艺、公共服务、科研教育等场景。（界面新闻）\u003c/p\u003e\n","content_more":"","content_text":"10月24日，智元在山东济南组织110台远征A3全尺寸人形机器人同时跳舞，创下“最多人形机器人同时跳舞”吉尼斯世界纪录。此次挑战采用智元灵动LinkBots集群调控平台及UWB厘米级定位技术，实现多机同步动作与编队切换。据悉，这批机器人后续将陆续投入文旅演艺、公共服务、科研教育等场景。（界面新闻）","cover_images":[],"display_time":1792823319,"fund_codes":[],"global_channel_name":"7x24快讯","global_more_uri":"wscn://wallstreetcn.com/live","has_live_reading":false,"highlight_title":"","id":3185109,"images":[],"is_calendar":false,"is_favourite":false,"is_priced":false,"is_scaling":false,"reference":"","related_themes":[],"score":1,"symbols":[],"tags":[],"title":"智元110台人形机器人同时跳舞，创吉尼斯世界纪录","type":"live","uri":"https://wallstreetcn.com/livenews/3185109"},{"article":null,"author":{"avatar":"https://wpimg-wscn.awtmt.com/571933c7-b3e8-4877-8b6b-ed1b1765b4fa","display_name":"石惠","id":6029,"is_followed":false,"uri":"https://wallstreetcn.com/authors/6029"},"ban_comment":false,"channels":["global-channel","forex-channel","goldc-channel","oil-channel","us-stock-channel"],"comment_count":1,"content":"\u003cp\u003e伊朗军方誓言阻止美国军舰进入波斯湾。（伊朗伊斯兰共和国通讯社）\u003c/p\u003e\n","content_more":"","content_text":"伊朗军方誓言阻止美国军舰进入波斯湾。（伊朗伊斯兰共和国通讯社）","cover_images":[],"display_time":1792820953,"fund_codes":[],"global_channel_name":"7x24快讯","global_more_uri":"wscn://wallstreetcn.com/live","has_live_reading":false,"highlight_title":"","id":3185108,"images":[],"is_calendar":false,"is_favourite":false,"is_priced":false,"is_scaling":false,"reference":"","related_themes":[],"score":1,"symbols":[],"tags":[],"title":"","type":"live","uri":"https://wallstreetcn.com/livenews/3185108"},{"article":null,"author":{"avatar":"https://wpimg-wscn.awtmt.com/571933c7-b3e8-4877-8b6b-ed1b1765b4fa","display_name":"石惠","id":6029,"is_followed":false,"uri":"https://wallstreetcn.com/authors/6029"},"ban_comment":false,"channels":["global-channel","bond-channel","a-stock-channel","xgb-channel"],"comment_count":0,"content":"\u003cp\u003e从京昆高铁西昆公司获悉，10月24日下午，随着最后一对500米长钢轨在渝昆高铁筠连隧道口铺设就位，渝昆高铁全线铺轨完成，为线路开通运营奠定坚实基础。（新华社）\u003c/p\u003e\n","content_more":"","content_text":"从京昆高铁西昆公司获悉，10月24日下午，随着最后一对500米长钢轨在渝昆高铁筠连隧道口铺设就位，渝昆高铁全线铺轨完成，为线路开通运营奠定坚实基础。（新华社）","cover_images":[],"display_time":1792820120,"fund_codes":[],"global_channel_name":"7x24快讯","global_more_uri":"wscn://wallstreetcn.com/live","has_live_reading":false,"highlight_title":"","id":3185107,"images":[],"is_calendar":false,"is_favourite":false,"is_priced":false,"is_scaling":false,"reference":"","related_themes":[],"score":1,"symbols":[],"tags":[],"title":"渝昆高铁全线铺轨完成","type":"live","uri":"https://wallstreetcn.com/livenews/3185107"},{"article":null,"author":{"avatar":"https://wpimg-wscn.awtmt.com/571933c7-b3e8-4877-8b6b-ed1b1765b4fa","display_name":"石惠","id":6029,"is_followed":false,"uri":"https://wallstreetcn.com/authors/6029"},"ban_comment":false,"channels":["global-channel","forex-channel","goldc-channel","oil-channel","us-stock-channel"],"comment_count":0,"content":"\u003cp\u003e据美国阿克西奥斯新闻网站23日报道，美国情报部门认为伊朗已“显著加大”针对美国驻中东及其他地区外交官和官员的行动力度，部分可能造成致命后果的袭击图谋已进入“高级阶段”。\u003c/p\u003e\n","content_more":"\u003cp\u003e报道称，该网站获取了一份23日提交给美国国务卿鲁比奥的非保密备忘录。美国国家情报总监杰伊·克莱顿在这份备忘录中警告称，有关伊朗袭击图谋的情报需要通报给更多目前还没有权限接收情报的美方人员。报道称，该备忘录并未披露伊朗袭击的具体目标、涉及哪些中东地区以外国家以及袭击方案等细节，但备忘录指出，相关情报已与国务院高级官员共享。\u003c/p\u003e\n\n\u003cp\u003e报道同时称，受安全形势影响，美国国务院本周早些时候已要求美国驻沙特大使馆以及驻吉达、宰赫兰领事机构非必要人员及家属撤离。23日，美国务院又下令减少驻阿联酋、黎巴嫩、卡塔尔和约旦使馆的外交及政府人员。上述情报是美政府决定缩减中东地区美方使领馆人员的原因之一。（新华社）\u003c/p\u003e\n","content_text":"据美国阿克西奥斯新闻网站23日报道，美国情报部门认为伊朗已“显著加大”针对美国驻中东及其他地区外交官和官员的行动力度，部分可能造成致命后果的袭击图谋已进入“高级阶段”。","cover_images":[],"display_time":1792820043,"fund_codes":[],"global_channel_name":"7x24快讯","global_more_uri":"wscn://wallstreetcn.com/live","has_live_reading":false,"highlight_title":"","id":3185106,"images":[],"is_calendar":false,"is_favourite":false,"is_priced":false,"is_scaling":false,"reference":"","related_themes":[],"score":1,"symbols":[],"tags":[],"title":"美情报称伊朗加大对美官员行动力度","type":"live","uri":"https://wallstreetcn.com/livenews/3185106"},{"article":null,"author":{"avatar":"https://wpimg-wscn.awtmt.com/571933c7-b3e8-4877-8b6b-ed1b1765b4fa","display_name":"石惠","id":6029,"is_followed":false,"uri":"https://wallstreetcn.com/authors/6029"},"ban_comment":false,"channels":["global-channel","a-stock-channel","bond-channel","xgb-channel"],"comment_count":0,"content":"\u003cp\u003e据山西日报消息，中共山西省第十三届委员会第一次全体会议10月24日选举唐登杰为省委书记，卢东亮、李金科（满族）为省委副书记，当选为省委常委的还有董晓宇、张碧涌、赵红严（女）、林红玉、张韶华、尤丽霞（女）、朱晓东、常书铭、王帅红。中共山西省第十三届纪委第一次全体会议选举尤丽霞（女）为省纪委书记，王晓鹏、徐德峰、刘东光、陈云鹏为省纪委副书记。\u003c/p\u003e\n","content_more":"","content_text":"据山西日报消息，中共山西省第十三届委员会第一次全体会议10月24日选举唐登杰为省委书记，卢东亮、李金科（满族）为省委副书记，当选为省委常委的还有董晓宇、张碧涌、赵红严（女）、林红玉、张韶华、尤丽霞（女）、朱晓东、常书铭、王帅红。中共山西省第十三届纪委第一次全体会议选举尤丽霞（女）为省纪委书记，王晓鹏、徐德峰、刘东光、陈云鹏为省纪委副书记。","cover_images":[],"display_time":1792819244,"fund_codes":[],"global_channel_name":"7x24快讯","global_more_uri":"wscn://wallstreetcn.com/live","has_live_reading":false,"highlight_title":"","id":3185105,"images":[],"is_calendar":false,"is_favourite":false,"is_priced":false,"is_scaling":false,"reference":"","related_themes":[],"score":1,"symbols":[],"tags":[],"title":"唐登杰当选山西省委书记","type":"live","uri":"https://wallstreetcn.com/livenews/3185105"},{"article":null,"author":{"avatar":"https://wpimg-wscn.awtmt.com/571933c7-b3e8-4877-8b6b-ed1b1765b4fa","display_name":"石惠","id":6029,"is_followed":false,"uri":"https://wallstreetcn.com/authors/6029"},"ban_comment":false,"channels":["global-channel","a-stock-channel","xgb-channel","commodity-channel"],"comment_count":0,"content":"\u003cp\u003e10月22日22时33分许，西藏那曲市巴青县发生7.0级地震。据中国地震台网，过去24小时，监测到的余震增加了391次。截至10月24日12时，共记录到余震892次，其中3.0级以下851次，3.0级及以上41次：3.0-3.9级33次，4.0-4.9级8次，5.0级及以上0次，目前最大余震4.5级。（央视新闻）\u003c/p\u003e\n","content_more":"","content_text":"10月22日22时33分许，西藏那曲市巴青县发生7.0级地震。据中国地震台网，过去24小时，监测到的余震增加了391次。截至10月24日12时，共记录到余震892次，其中3.0级以下851次，3.0级及以上41次：3.0-3.9级33次，4.0-4.9级8次，5.0级及以上0次，目前最大余震4.5级。（央视新闻）","cover_images":[],"display_time":1792819190,"fund_codes":[],"global_channel_name":"7x24快讯","global_more_uri":"wscn://wallstreetcn.com/live","has_live_reading":false,"highlight_title":"","id":3185104,"images":[],"is_calendar":false,"is_favourite":false,"is_priced":false,"is_scaling":false,"reference":"","related_themes":[],"score":1,"symbols":[],"tags":[],"title":"过去24小时 西藏巴青地震余震增加391次 最大震级4.5级","type":"live","uri":"https://wallstreetcn.com/livenews/3185104"},{"article":null,"author":{"avatar":"https://wpimg-wscn.awtmt.com/571933c7-b3e8-4877-8b6b-ed1b1765b4fa","display_name":"石惠","id":6029,"is_followed":false,"uri":"https://wallstreetcn.com/authors/6029"},"ban_comment":false,"channels":["global-channel","a-stock-channel","xgb-channel"],"comment_count":0,"content":"\u003cp\u003e中国地震台网正式测定：10月24日12时39分在新疆克孜勒苏州乌恰县（北纬39.90度，东经75.65度）发生3.7级地震，震源深度18千米。\u003c/p\u003e\n","content_more":"","content_text":"中国地震台网正式测定：10月24日12时39分在新疆克孜勒苏州乌恰县（北纬39.90度，东经75.65度）发生3.7级地震，震源深度18千米。","cover_images":[],"display_time":1792817110,"fund_codes":[],"global_channel_name":"7x24快讯","global_more_uri":"wscn://wallstreetcn.com/live","has_live_reading":false,"highlight_title":"","id":3185103,"images":[],"is_calendar":false,"is_favourite":false,"is_priced":false,"is_scaling":false,"reference":"","related_themes":[],"score":1,"symbols":[],"tags":[],"title":"","type":"live","uri":"https://wallstreetcn.com/livenews/3185103"},{"article":null,"author":{"avatar":"https://wpimg-wscn.awtmt.com/571933c7-b3e8-4877-8b6b-ed1b1765b4fa","display_name":"石惠","id":6029,"is_followed":false,"uri":"https://wallstreetcn.com/authors/6029"},"ban_comment":false,"channels":["global-channel","a-stock-channel","xgb-channel"],"comment_count":0,"content":"\u003cp\u003e任泽平公众号因违规被禁止关注。\u003c/p\u003e\n","content_more":"","content_text":"任泽平公众号因违规被禁止关注。","cover_images":[],"display_time":1792816232,"fund_codes":[],"global_channel_name":"7x24快讯","global_more_uri":"wscn://wallstreetcn.com/live","has_live_reading":false,"highlight_title":"","id":3185102,"images":[],"is_calendar":false,"is_favourite":false,"is_priced":false,"is_scaling":false,"reference":"","related_themes":[],"score":1,"symbols":[],"tags":[],"title":"","type":"live","uri":"https://wallstreetcn.com/livenews/3185102"},{"article":null,"author":{"avatar":"https://wpimg-wscn.awtmt.com/571933c7-b3e8-4877-8b6b-ed1b1765b4fa","display_name":"石惠","id":6029,"is_followed":false,"uri":"https://wallstreetcn.com/authors/6029"},"ban_comment":false,"channels":["global-channel","forex-channel"],"comment_count":0,"content":"\u003cp\u003e流行病防范创新联盟23日发表声明说，一项针对本迪布焦型埃博拉病毒候选疫苗的关键性临床试验当天在刚果（金）完成首名受试者接种。\u003c/p\u003e\n","content_more":"\u003cp\u003e据介绍，这项名为“希望”的临床试验由刚果（金）国家生物医学研究所和比利时安特卫普大学牵头，将评估多种候选疫苗的安全性、免疫原性及有效性。首个进入试验的候选疫苗为此前获批用于预防扎伊尔型埃博拉病毒的疫苗Ervebo，其对本迪布焦型埃博拉病毒的人体保护作用尚不明确。流行病防范创新联盟资助的两款针对本迪布焦型埃博拉病毒的特异性候选疫苗也将很快进入临床试验。（央视新闻）\u003c/p\u003e\n","content_text":"流行病防范创新联盟23日发表声明说，一项针对本迪布焦型埃博拉病毒候选疫苗的关键性临床试验当天在刚果（金）完成首名受试者接种。","cover_images":[],"display_time":1792815582,"fund_codes":[],"global_channel_name":"7x24快讯","global_more_uri":"wscn://wallstreetcn.com/live","has_live_reading":false,"highlight_title":"","id":3185101,"images":[],"is_calendar":false,"is_favourite":false,"is_priced":false,"is_scaling":false,"reference":"","related_themes":[],"score":1,"symbols":[],"tags":[],"title":"刚果（金）一关键性埃博拉疫苗临床试验启动接种","type":"live","uri":"https://wallstreetcn.com/livenews/3185101"}],"next_cursor":"1792815582","polling_cursor":"3185110"}}
